<section id="faq" class="card" aria-labelledby="faq-heading">
  <div class="card-header">
    <h2 id="faq-heading">Story FAQs</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="card-body">
    <h3 class="h5">Is GatherPack just for FIRST teams?</h3>
    <p>No — it started there, but now serves youth clubs, churches, nonprofits, and sports leagues with the same roster→events→finance→communication core. See <a href="/use-cases/nonprofits/">nonprofits</a> and <a href="/use-cases/churches/">churches</a>.</p>
    <h3 class="h5">Who owns GatherPack?</h3>
    <p><a href="https://brad-thompson.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Brad Thompson</a> leads development, published by <a href="https://sledgehammerinfosystems.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Sledgehammer Infosystems</a>, source under <a href="https://github.com/GatherPack/gatherpack/blob/main/LICENSE" target="_blank" rel="noopener">MIT</a> at <a href="https://github.com/GatherPack/gatherpack" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GatherPack/gatherpack</a>.</p>
